\ Expansion reaches a call inside a quotation literal, and the row it erases has to come back the
\ same way a row erased at a body's top level does.
\
\ The run here is recorded over the quotation's own rebuilt body rather than over `holder`'s array,
\ so the chain reads it from a second entry in the side table. Without that entry the `leaf` row is
\ missing and the `call` row below it names the wrong line.
\
\ No flags: one golden binds the interpreted and eager suites.

leaf: ( s v -- n ) const inline [ stream-write 0 + ] ;
holder: ( s v -- n ) [ [ leaf ] call 0 + ] ;

stdout 42 holder .
